{% comment %}
缘起 yuanqi：方向稿 A「古籍扉页」的正文段。右侧是竖排的段题签：一条墨线靠右，鱼尾、小标题（宋体 600，sub 档）、朱色楷书的卷次（壹、贰、叁…，按页面上的叙事段自动编号）自上而下；
中间是正文，lead 字号、两倍行距、两端对齐，栏宽收到 21 字，像刻本的满栏；小标题过长时按标点分成两列；左侧页边是要点，note 字号 ink-2，一条一道发丝界栏，像批在天头地脚的札记。
本排法要求小标题不超过 16 字（竖排上限）。没有朱笔、没有图像，是一段安静的阅读。
入场：题签从左侧轻推入（left，glide + paper，位移 space-3），正文上浮，页边要点逐条洇出（line 错峰）。
手机：单栏；题签改横排放在最上，鱼尾在前、卷次在后，墨线改到下方；正文降到 body 档，要点放在最后。
{% endcomment %}
<style>
  :scope {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    position: relative;
    padding: var(--ds-space-9) var(--ds-space-8);
    background: var(--ds-color-paper);
    color: var(--ds-color-ink);
    font-family: var(--ds-font-body);
    font-size: var(--ds-type-body);
    line-height: 1.85;
    counter-increment: pe-juan;
  }
  :scope::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    mix-blend-mode: multiply;
    opacity: .45;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='240' height='240'><filter id='n'><feTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='.85' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/><feColorMatrix values='0 0 0 0 .30 0 0 0 0 .24 0 0 0 0 .17 0 0 0 .16 0'/></filter><rect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/></svg>");
  }
  :scope * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  h2, h3, p, ul, ol, li, figure, figcaption, dl, dt, dd, blockquote { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  ul, ol { list-style: none; }
  .yuwei { display: block; flex: none; width: 24px; height: 16px; fill: var(--ds-color-ink); }
  .no::before { content: counter(pe-juan, simp-chinese-formal); }
  .sec {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 240px minmax(0, 1fr) 160px;
    gap: var(--ds-space-8);
    max-width: 1240px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .margin { align-self: start; margin-top: var(--ds-space-2); border-top: 1px solid var(--ds-color-rule); }
  .margin li {
    padding: var(--ds-space-3) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ds-color-rule-light);
    font-size: var(--ds-type-note);
    line-height: 1.7;
    letter-spacing: .04em;
    color: var(--ds-color-ink-2);
    font-feature-settings: "lnum" 1, "tnum" 1;
  }
  .prose {
    justify-self: center;
    max-width: 21em;
    font-size: var(--ds-type-lead);
    line-height: 2;
    text-align: justify;
    text-wrap: pretty;
    font-feature-settings: "onum" 1;
  }
  .head {
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--ds-space-4);
    justify-self: end;
    align-self: start;
    padding-right: var(--ds-space-4);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--ds-color-ink);
  }
  .head h2 { max-height: 9.6em; font-size: var(--ds-type-sub); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .3em; line-height: 1.6; word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .head .no { font-family: var(--ds-font-kai); font-size: var(--ds-type-lead); letter-spacing: .2em; color: var(--ds-color-zhu); }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    :scope { padding: var(--ds-space-9) var(--ds-space-5); }
    .sec { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: var(--ds-space-6); }
    .head { order: -1; writing-mode: horizontal-tb; justify-self: stretch; gap: var(--ds-space-3); padding: 0 0 var(--ds-space-3); border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ds-color-ink); }
    .head h2 { max-height: none; font-size: var(--ds-type-lead); letter-spacing: .1em; }
    .head .no { margin-left: auto; font-size: var(--ds-type-body); }
    .prose { font-size: var(--ds-type-body); }
    .margin { order: 2; margin-top: 0; }
  }
</style>
<div class="sec">
  <ul class="margin" data-ds-stagger="line">
    {% for point in slots.points %}<li data-ds-enter="fade" data-ds-step="ink" data-ds-ease="ink">{{ point }}</li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  <p class="prose" data-ds-enter="rise" data-ds-step="glide" data-ds-ease="paper" data-ds-distance="3" data-ds-order="1">{{ slots.body }}</p>
  <header class="head" data-ds-enter="left" data-ds-step="glide" data-ds-ease="paper" data-ds-distance="3" data-ds-order="0">
    <svg class="yuwei" viewBox="0 0 24 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 0H24V10L17 5.5L12 11.5L7 5.5L0 10Z"/></svg>
    <h2>{{ slots.heading }}</h2>
    <span class="no" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  </header>
</div>
